This package installs the CoolerControl daemon.
For the graphical interface, install the coolercontrol package.

Enable the service:

  # ln -s /etc/sv/coolercontrold /var/service/

Optional runtime dependencies, depending on your hardware:

  - liquidctl:    Driver support via liquidctl.
  - lm_sensors:   Kernel hwmon sensor support.
  - nvidia-utils: Support for NVIDIA GPUs.

Install them manually if you need them:

  # xbps-install -S liquidctl lm_sensors nvidia-util